      </p>

      <div class="button-row">
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/projects">
          Back to projects
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-soft">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>Case study in preparation</h2>

      <p>
        This project page will document the architecture, implementation,
        operational approach, technologies used and lessons learned.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
